<<speech "mc">>What does it feel like... when it starts working?<</speech>><br>

<<speech "thalara">>Tightness at first. A deep warmth spreading through your chest, like your very ribs making room. Then, weight. Tender fullness. Your clothes, those will remind you with every motion that you're no longer flat.<</speech>><br>
